1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:04,400
(Leonard:)What's up
with the infrared cameras?

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,900
(Sheldon:)I'm measuring residual heat
levels on the playing cards

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,500
(Sheldon:)to determine
which one's been touched.

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,370
(Sheldon:)By the way,

5
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:11,770
(Sheldon:)if you hope to have children,

6
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:13,640
(Sheldon:)I suggest you switch
from briefs to boxers.

7
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,540
(Sheldon:)Your testicles look a tad warm.

8
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:26,420
(Leonard:)Holy crap,
are you connected

9
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:28,590
(Leonard:)to the Oak Ridge
National Laboratory?

10
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:31,160
(Sheldon:)Yes. I'm using their
Cray supercomputer

11
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:32,460
(Sheldon:)to analyze
shuffling patterns.

12
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:35,400
(Leonard:)Sheldon, that computer
is used

13
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,660
for national defense.

14
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,330
(Leonard:)Hacking into it is
a federal crime.

15
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:41,500
(Sheldon:)Relax, we're not under
attack right now.

16
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:47,140
(Leonard:)Okay, I'm leaving before the
black helicopters get here.

17
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:51,880
(Sheldon:)And is this my card?

18
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:54,310
(Sheldon:)Rats!

19
00:00:57,080 --> 00:01:00,620
(Sheldon:)I wonder if Howard used
a radioactive tracer.

